# The keys helper releases are signed with: one line each, a label and the 32 raw bytes of an
# ed25519 public key in base64. The helper checks every update against them, and install.sh
# carries the same values. A release list signed by either key is accepted.
#
# primary   signs releases (Relay/release.sh).
# recovery  kept apart from the primary, for when the primary is lost or stolen. It can sign a
#           release list that hands helpers a new key (`next_key`).
#
# The private halves stay with whoever publishes releases and are never in this repository.
primary  Yn851QvA2ZzvkX/TkpqQcsiIOqUd2wi0jAFRbh+0OP0=
recovery p6Uwh2Qc232RxSymb4uFSkx/A/4Czn+/+QTz16RbLGE=
